{"id":"659025","name":"清炒赤松茸","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/659025/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"赤松茸","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"火葱头","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"赤松茸清洗干净。","img":"images/659025/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成片。","img":"images/659025/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜瓣、火葱头切碎，青椒掰成小片。","img":"images/659025/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅冷油，放入蒜末、火葱头炒香。","img":"images/659025/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入赤松茸翻炒一会。","img":"images/659025/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入青椒炒1分钟，加盐、少许生抽调味炒匀。","img":"images/659025/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659025/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}